  "question": {
    "text": "Magnetic flux through a coil of resistance $10 \\Omega$ is changed by $\\Delta \\phi$ in $0.1 \\mathrm{~s}$. The resulting current in the coil varies with time as shown in the figure. Then $|\\Delta \\phi|$ is equal to (in weber)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/IEwm4vf3MZmgAAq995SWfpIvp0Gd0U-i_hFf2VOVUaU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
