      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { As } \\begin{aligned}\ne=\\frac{\\Delta \\phi}{\\Delta t} & \\text { or } R i=\\frac{\\Delta \\phi}{\\Delta t} \\quad(\\because e=R i) \\\\\n\\Rightarrow \\quad \\Delta \\phi & =R(i . \\Delta t) \\\\\n& =R \\times \\text { area under } i-t \\text { graph } \\\\\n= & 10 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 0.1=2 \\text { weber }\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
